---
import { withBase } from "@/lib/site";
---

<section class="home-section subscribe-note" aria-labelledby="subscribe-title">
  <p class="home-kicker">KEEP IN TOUCH / 05</p>
  <div>
    <h2 id="subscribe-title">保持低频联系</h2>
    <p>
      暂不收集邮箱。通过 RSS 订阅，你可以在自己的阅读器里收到新文章，没有广告，也没有追踪。
    </p>
  </div>
  <a class="button button--primary" href={withBase("/rss.xml")}>订阅 RSS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
</section>
